 {"chapter": 1, "last_block": null, "first_block": null}, "project_id": "01a1e958-6086-77c1-9b37-0a4dd805f3e5", "decision_id": "01a1e95c-5a3d-7412-aae1-ce0ad3bc120f", "result_text": "{\"blocks\":1,\"chapter\":1,\"chapter_id\":\"01a1e958-f61b-74c0-a26a-f9f246582409\",\"first_block\":1,\"last_block\":1,\"revision_id\":\"01a1e959-1d4a-7270-a52b-3c8f918989aa\",\"title\":\"渡口\"}\n[block 1]\n雨下了一整夜。林舟站在渡口，等她的姐姐林雪把渡船从对岸撑回来。“你又来晚了。”林舟说。林雪没有回答，只把缆绳抛上了岸。", "caller_route": "model", "result_bytes": 365, "tool_call_id": "01a1e95c-5a40-7173-9877-1b67fb54cbcd", "call_position": 0, "function_name": "read_chapter", "result_digest": "sha256:f8ddcff0565f8b8002cc103db0fe0421f66178c108ce0635ca24a2247a1ca1ac", "effect_outcome": null, "argument_digest": "sha256:2b14703436535602b05356fae4f6e35406dce27a24200787dab58f6078650d92", "registration_id": "host_tools", "model_attempt_id": "01a1e95c-4399-72a3-aedd-88383d7fb353", "decision_position": 0, "tool_spec_revision": "storyos.tool.read-chapter.v1", "destination_attempt_id": null, "tool_registration_revision": "018f0000-0000-7001-8000-0000000e0104"}, {"state": "settled", "run_id": "01a1e95c-437a-7610-b5d7-ea549d7e607c", "attempt": null, "call_id": "call_ndh8a2lt5ub0i29o4dkt39la", "refusal": null, "arguments": {"observations": [{"text": "作者有固定写作习惯：人物对白中从不使用感叹号，人物情绪主要依靠动作和停顿来表现。后续审读、建议或续写对白时都应遵守这一克制风格。", "type": "writing_preference", "title": "对白禁用感叹号"}, {"text": "作者确定但正文尚未写出的核心伏笔：林雪早就知道父亲落水的真相，却一直瞒着林舟，计划直到最后一卷才说出来。真相的具体机制尚未确定；助手列出的可能包括：她亲眼看见却没救成（愧疚）、知道责任人而选择隐瞒（庇护或恐惧）、或父亲落水一事另有隐情。", "type": "foreshadowing", "title": "林雪知父亲落水真相"}]}, "project_id": "01a1e958-6086-77c1-9b37-0a4dd805f3e5", "decision_id": "01a1e95d-55c9-7bf3-9cf0-a5bc16fba47c", "result_text": "The Host recorded 2 observations, and the capture is complete.", "caller_route": "model", "result_bytes": 62, "tool_call_id": "01a1e95d-55cc-7423-8e60-b1a00149e1d1", "call_position": 0, "function_name": "record_memory_observations", "result_digest": "sha256:9f280af10dc2309a5ae3df0e7721bee4b4eeb8